{
  "about": "Game Settings' Extras > UI scale, in a 1440x900 window. Off (as the game is), the canvas is the window's own 1440x900 and the HUD keeps its size. On, the canvas is the classic 768 rows (1228x768): the basic info, the hotkeys, the chat, the minimap, the windows and their text all come out 900/768 bigger, and the world's view stays as it was. Everything still takes its clicks where it's drawn: Game Settings, centred again on the new canvas (a tab, its Close button), the game menu's Return, the inventory dragged by its title bar, and a ground cell the character then walks to. Off again, the canvas is the window's again. Main has no such switch.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "env": {"RUSTNAROK_CLIENT_WINDOW": "1440x900"},
  "steps": [
    {"say": "@warp morocc 160 120"},
    {"settle": 1500},
    {"say": "@heal"},
    {"key": "Escape"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_tab:5"}},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"key": "Alt+E"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_open": ["GameSettings", "Inventory"], "state": {"settings.tab": 5, "settings.ui_scale": false, "settings.canvas": [1440.0, 900.0]}}},
    {"move": [1000, 750]},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"shot": "ui-scale-off", "threshold": 5},
    {"click_on": {"button": "switch:7"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"expect": {"windows_open": ["GameSettings", "Inventory"], "state": {"settings.ui_scale": true, "settings.canvas": [1228.0, 768.0]}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_tab:0"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.tab": 0}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_tab:5"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.tab": 5}}},
    {"move": [1000, 700]},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"shot": "ui-scale-on", "threshold": 5},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_close"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "return"}, "hit": "GameMenu"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_closed": ["GameSettings", "GameMenu"], "windows_open": ["Inventory"]}},
    {"click": [150, 500], "hit": null},
    {"wait": 700},
    {"drag": [[120, 128], [220, 428]]},
    {"wait": 700},
    {"click": [150, 500], "hit": "Inventory"},
    {"wait": 700},
    {"click": [120, 250], "hit": null},
    {"wait": 700},
    {"say": "@warp morocc 160 120"},
    {"settle": 1500},
    {"click_on": {"cell": [164, 121]}},
    {"wait": 2500},
    {"expect": {"state": {"player.cell": [164, 121]}}},
    {"move": [1000, 700]},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"shot": "ui-scale-on-hud", "threshold": 5},
    {"key": "Alt+E"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"key": "Escape"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_tab:5"}},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"click_on": {"button": "switch:7"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.ui_scale": false, "settings.canvas": [1440.0, 900.0]}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_close"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "return"}, "hit": "GameMenu"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_closed": ["GameSettings", "GameMenu"]}}
  ]
}
